      "text": "give heed unto the word of the Lord, 1 Ne. 15:25. hear ye the words of the prophet, which were written, 1 Ne. 19:24. delighteth in the scriptures, and my heart pondereth them, 2 Ne. 4:15. read you the words of Isaiah, 2 Ne. 6:4. feasting upon the word of Christ, 2 Ne. 31:20 (32:3). they searched the scriptures, Jacob 7:23. remember to search them diligently, Mosiah 1:7 (Alma 17:2; 3 Ne. 23:1). unfold the scriptures beyond that which Amulek had done, Alma 12:1. scriptures … if ye will wrest them it shall be to your own destruction, Alma 13:20. began to repent, and to search the scriptures, Alma 14:1. ye ought to search the scriptures, Alma 33:2. hath the scriptures, let him search them, 3 Ne. 10:14. they are written … therefore search them, 3 Ne. 20:11. teach the things which he had expounded, 3 Ne. 23:14.",
